# API

- Use serializers for validation and permissions for access control.
- Keep complex business logic outside views and serializers.
- Preserve endpoint contracts and backward compatibility where possible.
- Check query performance, pagination, filtering, and object-level access.
- Update drf-spectacular schema when API behavior changes.
- Test success, validation, authentication, and permission cases.
